  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;div&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; style=&quot;margin-left:36.0pt&quot;&gt;The proposed crossover and\r\nvehicle access, by reason of its siting and loss of grass verge, would be\r\nan&amp;nbsp;incongruous&amp;nbsp;and unduly obtrusive feature within the street scene\r\nand would be detrimental to the character and appearance of the area. As such,\r\nthe works would fail to accord with the high quality design aspirations of\r\nNational Planning Policy Framework (2024), Policy D3.D(1) and (11) of the\r\nLondon Plan (2021), Core Policy CS1B of The Harrow Core Strategy (2012), Policy\r\nDM1 of Harrow Development Management Policies Local Plan (2013) and the adopted\r\nSupplementary Planning Document Residential Design Guide (2010) and GR1 of the\r\ndraft Harrow local plan 2021-2024.&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;"
